  characterName: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 714252b2335262640833c15d87d270ee, type: 2}
  text: When clicking on the scroll icon, an extra window will pop up in the left
    panel.  This window displays the scrolls that a party member currently has equipped. 
    Each scroll will grant the party member the ability to use a certain type of
    magic.  Only one scroll of a given kind can be equipped to a party member.  There
    is no need to equip several scrolls of the same kind to a single party member.
